 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: percentages in exported tables rounded halves to the even digit (1 of 8 showed as 12%); they now round half up.
 - CSV exports of frequency tables have a `weighted` column after `count`: the weighted count, to one decimal.
 - Multiple-choice cells in response CSV files separate the chosen options with `/` instead of `;`, which spreadsheets set to semicolon-delimited CSV split into columns.
 - `surveytally status` shows what a project folder holds.
